{"id":80,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Being bitten by a Shellder shocked this Pokémon into standing on two legs. If the Shellder lets go, it seems Slowbro will turn back into a Slowpoke."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Slowpoke became Slowbro when a Shellder bit on to its tail. Sweet flavors seeping from the tail make the Shellder feel as if its life is a dream."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Lives lazily by the sea. If the Shellder on its tail comes off, it becomes a Slowpoke again."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Shellder, in its greed to suck out more and more sweetness from Slowbro’s tail, has metamorphosed into a spiral-shaped shell."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Spacing out is basically all it does. It turns back into Slowpoke if its tail, along with Shellder, breaks off."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Whenever Shellder bites down hard on its tail, it gives Slowbro a flash of inspiration...which it forgets a moment later."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It spaces out while gazing at the sea. With Shellder’s poison flowing through its body, it becomes even spacier."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Slowbro’s tail has a Shellder firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes Slowbro to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead."},{"games":["Y","FireRed"],"text":"When a Slowpoke went hunting in the sea, its tail was bitten by a Shellder. That made it evolve into Slowbro."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"An attached Shellder won’t let go because of the tasty flavor that oozes out of its tail."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Naturally dull to begin with, it lost its ability to feel pain due to SHELLDER’s seeping poison."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"If the tail-biting SHELLDER is thrown off in a harsh battle, it reverts to being an ordinary SLOWPOKE."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"The SHELLDER that latches onto SLOWPOKE’s tail is said to feed on the host’s leftover scraps."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This forces it to reluctantly swim and catch prey."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"The SHELLDER that is latched onto SLOWPOKE's tail is said to feed on the host's left over scraps."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Oblivious","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is oblivious, keeping it from being infatuated, falling for taunts, or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Own Tempo","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon sticks to its own tempo, preventing it from becoming confused or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Regenerator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon has a little of its HP restored when withdrawn from battle."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Pink","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":79,"name":"Slowpoke","condition":null,"children":[{"id":80,"name":"Slowbro","condition":"Lv. 37 or Use Galarica Cuff","children":[]},{"id":199,"name":"Slowking","condition":"Trade, holding King’s Rock or Use Galarica Wreath","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[1,55],[1,110],[1,174],[9,281],[12,93],[15,50],[18,352],[21,29],[24,428],[27,133],[30,57],[33,303],[36,94],[41,244],[46,240],[51,505]],"machine":[133,419,59,776,34,280,523,347,886,174,91,409,89,203,797,263,126,53,374,411,264,492,248,416,447,270,56,63,58,8,196,286,334,113,710,118,341,330,417,182,60,244,94,917,678,473,240,156,503,247,285,214,883,500,164,241,57,129,36,851,86,271,433,352,127,311,250,428],"egg":[248],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-90","name":"Slowbro","set":"Pitch Black"